    <Description>Roblox-Magic Training

This macro automatically types /deletrius
Clcik the left mouse button to shoot the spell and instantly kills the target

Deletrius:
The Eradication Spell, also known as Deletrius, is a spell that causes the target to evaporate, dissolve or disintegrate into a gray cloud of debris. A cast of Deletrius fires a bright purple beam. When a victim is hit, this causes the victim's health bar to reduced to zero within a fraction of a second, as they aesthetically dissolve or evaporate when perishing.
(from Magic training wiki)</Description>
